      "writtenOn": "2021-09-07T22:30:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there any particular reason you are erasing the regs from pdata after they were saved, instead of blocking the saving of them in the first place?",
      "revId": "8217483146d5dc4873c7a73c57e83f04537a217a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
